# The generated documentation page inlines cmd/docs-gen/assets, and inlines the
# SVGs percent-encoded into a data URI. A CRLF survives that encoding as a
# literal %0D%0A, which no line-ending normalisation can reach, so a page
# regenerated on Windows differs from one regenerated on Linux and the golden
# test in cmd/docs-gen fails for a reason that is invisible in the diff.
#
# Checking these out verbatim keeps the page reproducible on every platform.
cmd/docs-gen/assets/* text eol=lf
docs/index.html text eol=lf
docs/tool-reference.md text eol=lf
